      "description": "StackBlitz is a friendly bot, which provides a one-click link that spins up the whole environment for pull requests and issues. \r\n\r\nNo more context-switching or branch-checkouts, just a new browser tab with a full IDE and a dev server running.\r\n\r\n<img lang=\"en\" alt=\"StackBlitz bot in action\" width=\"400px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stackblitz/docs/0eff5a2b8bee06f58d51179e69d1ec014c1f8e32/docs/guides/codeflow/assets/codeflowapp-pr.png\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Why should I use StackBlitz bot?\r\n\r\nThe bot prepares an entire IDE to review the pull request or check the reproduction. You no longer need to clone, run dependencies, switch branches, stash your previous work - one click and the entire environment boots up for you.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
